    {
      "subId": "37702",
      "subQuestName": "Return to the tavern the following night",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3770201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3770201": {
            "id": "3770201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "You're here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770202"
            ]
          },
          "3770202": {
            "id": "3770202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "#Wait, you're... {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770205"
            ]
          },
          "3770205": {
            "id": "3770205",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Well, first of all, I contacted more than one person.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770206"
            ]
          },
          "3770206": {
            "id": "3770206",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Secondly, she came here as \"Jean\" herself, not as the Acting Grand Master.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770207"
            ]
          },
          "3770207": {
            "id": "3770207",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "A Jean you would never see, even as an Honorary Knight.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770208"
            ]
          },
          "3770208": {
            "id": "3770208",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "What a surprise.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770209"
            ]
          },
          "3770209": {
            "id": "3770209",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "I heard about the Holy Lyre, but I never suspected it was you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770210"
            ]
          },
          "3770210": {
            "id": "3770210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "So, the sound of the Holy Lyre can purify Stormterror and return it to normal... Is that true?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770211"
            ]
          },
          "3770211": {
            "id": "3770211",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "#That's right! {NICKNAME} is putting themselves on the front line to try and resolve this Stormterror issue.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770212"
            ]
          },
          "3770212": {
            "id": "3770212",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Now that's the hotshot of the Knights of Favonius I'm talking about.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770213"
            ]
          },
          "3770213": {
            "id": "3770213",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Feels like we're breaking the law though...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770214"
            ]
          },
          "3770214": {
            "id": "3770214",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "I understand this kind of absurd explanation is hard to believe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770215"
            ]
          },
          "3770215": {
            "id": "3770215",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "But, we can ask the bard to play the song again to try and persuade—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770216"
            ]
          },
          "3770216": {
            "id": "3770216",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "I believe you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770217"
            ]
          },
          "3770217": {
            "id": "3770217",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "To persuade our stubborn comman— Wait, what?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770218"
            ]
          },
          "3770218": {
            "id": "3770218",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "I can't think of any reason for Dvalin's betrayal, given it was once one of The Four Winds.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770219"
            ]
          },
          "3770219": {
            "id": "3770219",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "However, if it was poisoned in the battle over Mondstadt all those years ago...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770220"
            ]
          },
          "3770220": {
            "id": "3770220",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "And then corrupted by the Abyss Mage after it woke up — we can't really blame it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770221"
            ]
          },
          "3770221": {
            "id": "3770221",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "But as Acting Grand Master I obviously cannot make such a statement publicly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770222"
            ]
          },
          "3770222": {
            "id": "3770222",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "Diplomatic pressure from the Fatui makes it hard for us to seek a peaceful resolution to the Stormterror issue.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770223"
            ]
          },
          "3770223": {
            "id": "3770223",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "People would think I've lost grip on the gravity of the situation. That's why I can only do this in private.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770224"
            ]
          },
          "3770224": {
            "id": "3770224",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Hmph.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770225"
            ]
          },
          "3770225": {
            "id": "3770225",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "That's one of the reasons I don't like the Knights of Favonius.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770226"
            ]
          },
          "3770226": {
            "id": "3770226",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "What surprises me is that you would believe an outlander so easily...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770227"
            ]
          },
          "3770227": {
            "id": "3770227",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "#My cautious and meticulous <color=#00E1FFFF>superior</color>, even you trust {M#him}{F#her}. Don't you, sir?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3770228"
            ]
          },
          "3770228": {
            "id": "3770228",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "I already told you not to call me sir... Never mind. We don't often get to work together after all."
          }
        }
      }
    },
